<Behavior #windows-sandbox-fallback apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #tiered-fallback (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMR>
      Windows sandbox SHALL 采用分级模式（elevated/restricted-token/disabled）：runner 可用且 setup 完成时 SHALL 走 windows-elevated；runner 未安装或未 setup 时 SHALL 走普通执行 + 保留文件权限检查（不 ENOENT）。bash 报错 SHALL 显式可诊断（缺失 runner、EIDOLON_WINDOWS_SANDBOX_RUNNER、绕过选项）。
      </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMR>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #windows-sandbox-tiered { name = "Windows sandbox tiered fallback" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #runner-missing-disabled [
              <Then ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMS>
              windowsSandboxLevel SHALL 为 disabled
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMS>
              <Then ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMT>
              bash SHALL 走普通执行 + 保留文件权限检查，SHALL NOT 报 ENOENT
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMT>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMV>
              运行平台是 win32 且 windows-sandbox-runner 不存在
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMV>
              <When ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMW>
              解析 sandbox backend selection
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMW>
            )>
            <Case #runner-available-elevated [
              <Then ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMX>
              windowsSandboxLevel SHALL 为 elevated
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMX>
              <Then ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMY>
              bash SHALL 走 eidolon-windows-sandbox-runner
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMY>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMZ>
              运行平台是 win32 且 runner 存在且 setup 完成
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHMZ>
              <When ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHN0>
              解析 sandbox backend selection
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHN0>
            )>
            <Case #diagnosable-error (
              <Given ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHN1>
              配置显式要求 elevated 但 runner 缺失
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHN1>
              <When ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHN2>
              bash 执行
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHN2>
              <Then ?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHN3>
              报错 SHALL 包含 EIDOLON_WINDOWS_SANDBOX_RUNNER 提示
              </?01M05F1P4F91H6H72WCTWQTHN3>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
